  "name": "PhysioNet Sepsis Challenge 2019",
  "alternateName": [
    "PhysioNet/Computing in Cardiology Challenge 2019",
    "Early Prediction of Sepsis from Clinical Data"
  ],
  "description": "Benchmark dataset for early prediction of sepsis from hourly ICU clinical measurements, from the PhysioNet/Computing in Cardiology Challenge 2019. Contains data from 40,336 ICU patients across three hospital systems (two publicly available). Each patient record includes 8 vital signs, 26 laboratory values, and 6 demographic fields sampled hourly, with Sepsis-3 onset labels. Freely downloadable (CC-BY 4.0) without a data use agreement. Reference implementations provided in Python, MATLAB, Julia, and R. The canonical open benchmark for sepsis early warning algorithm development and comparison.",
  "url": "https://physionet.org/content/challenge-2019/1.0.0/",
